idding.\nFunctionality:\nParts ONLY\n- Not tested and function is unknown. No returns or refunds accepted for this auction. Keep this in mind when bidding. SOLD AS-IS.\nPowered on/ Reset\n- Item appears to power on or have operable mechanisms when plugged in. This item has been RESET. It has not been tested for functionality in any capacity and functionality is not guaranteed. Unless stated or pictured, the cord/adaptor is not included with the item. We do our best to identify all items but cannot guarantee accuracy. You are bidding with this in mind. SOLD AS-IS\nNot Tested/Not Powered on\n- Item has not been plugged in or powered on. It has not been tested for functionality in any capacity and functionality is not guaranteed. Unless stated or pictured, the cord/adaptor is not included with the item. We do our be SOLD AS-IS.\nNew\n- This item appears to be new; however, it is a donated item. We have not powered it on or tested this item. It has not been tested for functionality in any capacity and functionality is not guaranteed. We do our best to identify all items, but cannot SOLD AS-IS\nDisclaimers:\nUnless stated item does not include power cords, cables, a/c adapters or batteries. Any included batteries may require replacement\nItems that include the original box, we cannot verify or guarantee that all contents are included. Please review pictures for more details. \"In Open Box\" otherwise known as \"IOB\" auctions are\nSOLD AS-IS\nPlease see photos for overall cosmetic condition. We are not experts at grading conditions/s of donated items. Unless stated otherwise, expect items to have wear from use. Item may require cleaning.\nSorted LEGO’s\n- We have carefully sorted and removed as many non-LEGO pieces as possible. Keep in mind though we are human and unintentionally may have missed some. This is not done intentionally. This lot may include KNex, Megabloks, Tyco, or other brands of building blocks and toys. The pieces are used and are no longer in their orig